@startuml
' Diagram-Owner: docs/reports/architecture/chorotate-architecture-decision.md
' Parent-Plan: docs/epics/chorotate/core-experience/prds/chorotate-mvp.md
title ChoRotate MVP Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif

actor "Allowed household\nmember" as Member

cloud "Google OAuth" as Google
cloud "Textbelt public free API\nPOST /text, key=textbelt\n1 SMS segment/day" as Textbelt

node "Cloudflare Worker\nReact Router v8 + TypeScript" as Worker {
  component "fetch\nRoutes, loaders, actions" as Fetch
  component "Route-local auth +\nallowlist + origin checks" as Access
  component "Chore-period / rotation /\nassignment services" as Domain
  component "scheduled\nOutbox dispatcher" as Scheduled
}

database "Cloudflare D1\nAuthoritative state" as D1 {
  component "Household, members + E.164\ncontact consent/suppression,\nchores, rotation config" as Config
  component "Materialized chore-period\nassignments + versions" as Assignments
  component "Better Auth users,\naccounts, sessions" as Sessions
  component "Append-only audit events\n+ immutability triggers" as Audit
  component "SMS occurrences, claims,\nquota/result/unknown evidence" as Outbox
}

Member --> Fetch : HTTPS / secure cookie
Fetch --> Access
Access --> Sessions : validate revocable session
Access --> Config : check exact active email
Fetch --> Google : OAuth redirect/callback
Fetch --> Domain : authenticated reads/mutations
Domain --> Assignments : materialize, reassign, swap
Assignments --> Audit : trigger appends before/after event
Domain --> Outbox : create/supersede SMS occurrence\nmark correction-needed

Scheduled --> Outbox : claim bounded due batch
Scheduled --> Textbelt : one-segment SMS; no idempotency key
Textbelt --> Scheduled : textId / quota / result when known
Scheduled --> Outbox : persist accepted, failed,\nmissed, or delivery_unknown\n(no ambiguous/next-day retry)

note right of Textbelt
  Free key has no reply webhook.
  Exactly-once handset delivery
  cannot be guaranteed.
end note

note right of D1
  No KV, Durable Objects, Queues,
  AWS, or competing state authority.
end note

@enduml
